---
description: Place tests beside the package they test, not under tests/orion
alwaysApply: true
---

# Test location

Put each test in `tests/<package>/`, where `<package>` is the Orion package under test.

- `orion/core/invoke.py` → `tests/core/test_invoke.py`
- `orion/clients/openmeteo.py` → `tests/clients/test_openmeteo.py`
- `orion/ui/configuration.py` → `tests/ui/test_configuration_tab.py`

`tests/orion/` is not a test root.
